C. N. McCowan, C.-M. Wang, and J. D. Splett. Computing Uncertainty for Charpy Impact Machine Test Results, 2007 edition, NIST Recommended Practice Guide, SP 960-18e1. [Official metadata and report DOI](https://www.nist.gov/publications/nist-recommended-practice-guidecomputing-uncertainty-charpy-impact-machine-test-0) · [Edition DOI](https://doi.org/10.6028/NBS.SP.960-18e1).

Read the entire selected edition, methods, example calculations, uncertainty assumptions, and references. Identify the actual machine verification and specimen/testing evidence required for the intended comparison. Charpy absorbed energy is not automatically a fracture-toughness value or a full structural-integrity assessment.

Official edition, author list, identifier, and source route checked on 29 October 2026. Earlier SP 960-18 versions have a differing author list; preserve the edition actually consulted. Agency/component notices and the actual current practical test standard remain relevant. No guide, test data, reference-specimen information, or copyrighted standard is bundled.

